  m_Name: Dlg_Wrong_RS_02_DownloadLink
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Guide
    text: That button is an advertisement, not the download. On a real download page
      it is usually the biggest, greenest thing on the screen, and it installs something
      nobody asked for. The real download is the file name in the version table.
